WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:14.153
Hopian: You can’t hold me here forever!

2
00:00:14.154 --> 00:00:17.890
Tristay: You’re right. I need something else to hold you.

3
00:00:17.891 --> 00:00:20.724
Tristay: Drag him to the post! Now!

4
00:00:20.725 --> 00:00:27.436
Hold his hands together!

5
00:00:27.437 --> 00:00:29.223
Hopian: What is that?

6
00:00:29.224 --> 00:00:37.325
Tristay: It’s something to hold you tight.

7
00:00:37.326 --> 00:00:40.159
Hopian: The rope is so cold!

8
00:00:40.160 --> 00:00:46.155
Tristay: Watch me prepare something special for those troublesome kids.

9
00:00:46.156 --> 00:00:56.185
Tristay: But first I need to increase my power.

10
00:00:56.186 --> 00:00:58.580
Hopian: They’re so beautiful . . .

11
00:00:58.581 --> 00:01:00.620
Tristay: I think so too.

12
00:01:00.621 --> 00:01:03.996
They will help me stop those kids.

13
00:01:03.997 --> 00:01:06.529
Hopian: What are you going to do?

14
00:01:06.530 --> 00:01:13.416
Tristay: You’ll see.

15
00:01:13.417 --> 00:01:16.242
Tristay: You will fly high from this mountaintop.

16
00:01:16.243 --> 00:01:20.268
You will attack from the air.

17
00:01:20.269 --> 00:01:22.577
Hopian: Good. He’s busy.

18
00:01:22.578 --> 00:01:28.986
I’ve got to warn the kids.

19
00:01:28.987 --> 00:01:31.828
Hopian: If only I could reach my hat . . .

20
00:01:31.829 --> 00:01:33.867
It’s no use.

21
00:01:33.868 --> 00:01:37.104
Hopian: This rope is too strong.

22
00:01:37.105 --> 00:01:40.875
Hopian: Wait a minute, what did I tell Danny?

23
00:01:40.876 --> 00:01:44.304
Use your imagination.

24
00:01:44.305 --> 00:01:53.384
Hopian: Come to me, my little friend. Come to me.

25
00:01:53.385 --> 00:01:56.328
Hopian: Good bug! Now hurry.

26
00:01:56.329 --> 00:02:08.277
You must find Danny and warn him!

27
00:02:08.278 --> 00:02:10.476
Tristay: Isn’t it beautiful?

28
00:02:10.477 --> 00:02:12.451
Hopian: No.

29
00:02:12.452 --> 00:02:14.286
Tristay: I think it is.

30
00:02:14.287 --> 00:02:22.143
Tirstay: And it will be even more beautiful when it eats those kids!

31
00:02:22.144 --> 00:02:28.975
Danny: Now that we’ve restored color to the water, [n3@we’re one step closer to defeating Tristay.

32
00:02:28.976 --> 00:02:30.398
Tina: What’s next?

33
00:02:30.399 --> 00:02:34.278
Brad: The flowers. We need to make them red again.

34
00:02:34.279 --> 00:02:36.917
Tina: There were flowers in Hopian’s garden.

35
00:02:36.918 --> 00:02:38.902
We could start with those.

36
00:02:38.903 --> 00:02:40.458
Danny: Great idea!

37
00:02:40.459 --> 00:02:44.761
Tina: It should be easy now that those evil creatures are all gone.

38
00:02:44.762 --> 00:02:55.018
Brad: I hope there are no other evil things waiting for us.

39
00:02:55.019 --> 00:02:58.842
Tina: Wow. This would look so pretty except . . .

40
00:02:58.843 --> 00:03:01.545
Brad: Except that it’s so gray.

41
00:03:01.546 --> 00:03:02.990
Bello: Gray.

42
00:03:02.991 --> 00:03:11.328
Danny: But once we put the color back, it’s going to look fantastic! Hmm . . .

43
00:03:11.329 --> 00:03:14.876
Brad: I don’t think throwing the clay on the flowers will work.

44
00:03:14.877 --> 00:03:17.159
Tina: No.

45
00:03:17.160 --> 00:03:22.686
Danny: How are we going to make the flowers red?
